	(text "MAT_MONITOR_RAW feeds the high-input-impedance OPA197 follower on\nsheet 2000. Set the monitor and TIA range before conversion. Initial\nvalidation uses <=100 kSPS and a 20 us post-change delay, subject to\nanalog settling verification. Analog buffers and switches use\nP15/N15."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 310.11 174.34 0)
		(effects
